@startuml outreach-flow
title Сквозной outreach flow: решение, исполнение, наблюдение
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

participant "data-governance" as Governance
participant "lead-management" as Leads
participant "audience" as Audience
participant "content-production" as Content
participant "request-fulfillment" as Requests
participant "outreach-orchestration" as Outreach
participant "message-delivery" as Delivery
participant "engagement-observation" as Engagement
participant "analytics" as Analytics

Governance -> Leads : data-zone-policy
Leads -> Leads : нормализовать и верифицировать lead-profile
Leads --> Audience : lead-profile
Audience -> Audience : рассчитать score и зафиксировать audience-snapshot
Audience --> Outreach : audience-snapshot
Content --> Outreach : content-version
Outreach -> Governance : проверить processing-authority
Governance --> Outreach : authority decision
Requests -> Content : content-request
Content --> Requests : material (тема + тело)
Requests -> Outreach : outreach-handoff [request_id]
Outreach -> Outreach : создать кампанию заявки и action-draft
Outreach -> Outreach : зафиксировать operator-decision
opt выбран канал «звонок»
  Outreach -> Outreach : запланировать call (call-scheduled)
end
alt действие одобрено
  Outreach -> Delivery : approved-action [idempotency key]
  Delivery -> Governance : preflight suppression check
  Governance --> Delivery : suppression decision
  alt отправка разрешена
    Delivery -> Delivery : исполнить через provider port
    Delivery --> Engagement : delivery-event
    Delivery --> Analytics : delivery-event
    Engagement -> Engagement : deduplicate и квалифицировать signal
    Engagement --> Outreach : engagement-event
    Engagement --> Analytics : engagement-event
  else адресат подавлен
    Delivery --> Outreach : contact-suppressed
    Delivery --> Analytics : analytics-event
  end
else действие отклонено
  Outreach --> Analytics : analytics-event
end
' CTX:data-governance
' CTX:lead-management
' CTX:audience
' CTX:content-production
' CTX:request-fulfillment
' CTX:outreach-orchestration
' CTX:message-delivery
' CTX:engagement-observation
' CTX:analytics
@enduml
